| `src/components/desktop/Tab.vue` | Modify | `template` (tab name row) | Added a conditional `<i class="fa-solid fa-video … text-success">` shown only when the tab is a Meet panel and the camera is on. Includes `title`/`aria-label` for accessibility. |
| `src/components/desktop/Tab.vue` | Modify | `computed` → `isMeet` | New computed: returns true when the app is the Meet app (`key`/`component` === `'meet'`). |
| `src/components/desktop/Tab.vue` | Modify | `computed` → `meetId` | New computed: resolves the meet id from live app params with a fallback to raw panel params. |
| `src/components/desktop/Tab.vue` | Modify | `computed` → `cameraOn` | New computed: reads `$storex.meets.activeMeets[meetId].localStream` and checks for a video track. |
| `src/components/desktop/Tab.vue` | Modify | `computed` → `showCameraIcon` | New computed: `isMeet && cameraOn` — gates rendering of the icon. |

